1. DECODE: the two logs are LOGITS of two biases
==========================================================================
  t = p - q = 2p - 1  =>  (1+t)/(1-t) = p/q  (the odds).
  p_A = 1285/2181   q_A = 896/2181   odds p_A/q_A = 1285/896   matches 1285/896: True
  p_B = 8847357/11821757   q_B = 2974400/11821757   odds p_B/q_B = 8847357/2974400   matches 8847357/2974400: True
  => eq(27) IS   (2457/6592)*logit(p_B) - logit(p_A) > 1/25,   logit(p) = log(p/q).

